Also add `using ShipmentTracker.Endpoints;` at the top.

Also add after `builder.Services.AddSingleton<IEmailSender<ApplicationUser>, IdentityNoOpEmailSender>();`:
```csharp
builder.Services.AddAuthorizationBuilder()
    .AddPolicy("DispatcherOnly", policy => policy.RequireRole("Dispatcher"))
    .AddPolicy("CustomerOnly", policy => policy.RequireRole("Customer"));
```

And add role seeding. After `var app = builder.Build();` add:
```csharp
// Seed roles
using (var scope = app.Services.CreateScope())
{
    var roleManager = scope.ServiceProvider.GetRequiredService<RoleManager<IdentityRole>>();
    string[] roles = ["Dispatcher", "Customer"];
    foreach (var role in roles)
    {
        if (!await roleManager.RoleExistsAsync(role))
        {
            await roleManager.CreateAsync(new IdentityRole(role));
        }
    }
}
```

Make sure to add `.AddRoles<IdentityRole>()` to the identity configuration chain (after `.AddIdentityCore<ApplicationUser>(...)`).

